  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 311.04 Application Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 311.04 Application Information. The applicant shall complete and submit Form NHDES-W-06-012, “Standard Dredge and Fill Wetlands Permit Application”, dated January 2026 that has been signed and certified as specified in Env-Wt 311.11.\n\nSource. #12803, eff 12-15-19; amd by #12954, eff 12-24-19; amd by #13124, eff 10-23-20; ss by #13777, eff 10-13-23; ss by #14349, INTERIM, eff 8-26-25; ss by #14471, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES: 1-2-36",
